#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ This is extending the vanilla snippets belonging to mostly work of random
#. people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos that people share, or
#. something they can film by themselves.
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/e_logs.json
msgid ""
"hunternetlinda.mp4\n"
"Electronic music plays on a black screen.  Text appears on the screen\n"
"'Stand still, pause clocks, we can make the world stop'\n"
"A video montage follows a woman across multiple days and outfits.  On errands, at work, traveling in different cities.  About a minute into the montage of video there are short cuts to her violently attacking people in secluded settings.  Those gradually become the dominant images until it's only video of her feasting on the blood of her fallen victims.  The final image is her looking up; face covered, blood dripping down onto her ruined outfit; eyes staring straight into the camera as the image freezes.  On the now black screen, a name and address appear."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<XE_NIGHT_MESSAGES_GENERAL_1>"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"The clopping of hooves pass you by with a swift breeze, yet you did not see "
"anything except for local flora brushed by the wind."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<XE_NIGHT_MESSAGES_GENERAL_1>"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"As you are walking you suddenly hear a woman singing mournfully.  As you look"
" around trying to see where the sound is coming from you slowly realize that "
"if you take more than a step and a half in any direction the song fades away."
"  Eventually you are unable to find it again."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<XE_NIGHT_MESSAGES_GENERAL_1>"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"Something roars in the night, similar sounding to one of the Kaiju you heard "
"destroying a nearby town during the Cataclysm."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<XE_NIGHT_MESSAGES_GENERAL_1>"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid "The night suddenly goes dead silent."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<XE_NIGHT_MESSAGES_GENERAL_1>"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"You hear a wolf howl in the distance, swiftly joined by several others.  "
"After a moment of silence, you hear another series of howls, and then "
"another.  It's only after the third set fades that you realize the howls were"
" all in exactly the same pattern; two long, three short."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<XE_NIGHT_MESSAGES_GENERAL_1>"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"You hear a scream in the distance.  Probably a deer or a bobcat, but it sure "
"sounded like a human."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<XE_NIGHT_MESSAGES_GENERAL_1>"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"Disturbed by your approach, a small animal darts away into the underbrush.  "
"It's only after it disappears that you realize it had six legs."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<XE_NIGHT_MESSAGES_GENERAL_1>"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"Your ears pop, leaving behind a high-pitched whine that fades as normal "
"sounds slowly return."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<XE_NIGHT_MESSAGES_GENERAL_1>"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"For a moment, the air smells so strongly metallic that you can almost taste "
"it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<XE_NIGHT_MESSAGES_GENERAL_1>"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid "You hear a rush of unfelt wind."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<XE_NIGHT_MESSAGES_GENERAL_1>"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"The wind makes a low murmur that sounds almost like words.  When you stop to "
"pay attention to it, it falls silent."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "XE_NIGHT_MESSAGES_CLEAR_1"
#. ~ Snippet in category "XE_NIGHT_MESSAGES_CLOUDY_1"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid "<XE_NIGHT_MESSAGES_GENERAL_1>"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "XE_NIGHT_MESSAGES_CLEAR_1"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"Winged shadows cross the ground, but when you look into the sky you can't see"
" any movement or shapes."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "XE_NIGHT_MESSAGES_CLEAR_1"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"There is a bright red star with a dark heart that looks like a pupil, staring"
" down on you from the sky above.  Is that star in the sky every night?  Is it"
" coming closer to the planet?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "XE_NIGHT_MESSAGES_CLEAR_1"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"A helicopter passes by overhead.  All its running lights have been blacked "
"out and you suspect the rotors have been muffled.  If it hadn't passed right "
"over you, you'd have never known it was there."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "XE_NIGHT_MESSAGES_CLEAR_1"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"Something passes across the moon for a moment, completely blotting it out."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "XE_NIGHT_MESSAGES_CLEAR_1"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid "A shooting star flashes across the sky."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "XE_NIGHT_MESSAGES_CLEAR_1"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"A pair of owls flies by, so close that they're almost wingtip to wingtip."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "XE_NIGHT_MESSAGES_CLEAR_1"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid "For a moment, all the stars turn a dim reddish color."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "XE_NIGHT_MESSAGES_CLOUDY_1"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"A single raindrop falls on your exposed skin.  You look up, but no further "
"droplets fall."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "XE_NIGHT_MESSAGES_CLOUDY_1"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"Something above the clouds glows, creating a hazy patch of light.  It stays "
"in place for a few moments before speeding away to the <random_direction>."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "XE_NIGHT_MESSAGES_CLOUDY_1"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"You see the vague outlines of a humanoid figure in the distance.  As soon as "
"you catch sight of it, there is a blur of motion and it vanishes."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "XE_NIGHT_MESSAGES_CLOUDY_1"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"You step in a small puddle, but when you bend down to look, there's nothing "
"there."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "XE_NIGHT_MESSAGES_CLOUDY_1"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"You feel something tap on your shoulder but when you spin around to look, "
"there's no one there."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "XE_NIGHT_MESSAGES_CLOUDY_1"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"You hear a slithering sound in the distance.  It's far enough away that "
"whatever is making it must be very large."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "XE_NIGHT_MESSAGES_CLOUDY_1"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid "You hear a cracking sound and then the night falls totally silent."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "XE_DAY_MESSAGES_1"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"You realize that all of your empty pockets have been turned inside out.  How "
"long ago this happened you can't say."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "XE_DAY_MESSAGES_1"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid "You hear a tinkling sound on the wind."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "XE_DAY_MESSAGES_1"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid "A horn plays somewhere far in the distance; deep, mournful, and low."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "XE_DAY_MESSAGES_1"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid "Suddenly you smell rotten wood and tobacco."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "XE_DAY_MESSAGES_1"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"You hear a distant explosion.  You can't tell if it came from one of the "
"tendrils of smoke at the edge of your vision or if it's new."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "XE_DAY_MESSAGES_1"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid "A single shot fires in the distance then silence."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "XE_DAY_MESSAGES_1"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid "The birds are no longer singing here.  It's quiet, scary quiet."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "XE_DAY_MESSAGES_1"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"A rare plane leaves contrails high in the sky.  You wonder where it could be "
"coming from and where it could possibly be going."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "XE_DAY_MESSAGES_1"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"The sunlight seems to dim for a moment.  When you blink, it's as bright as it"
" was before."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "XE_DAY_MESSAGES_1"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"Your footstep suddenly crunch loudly.  When you look down, the ground beneath"
" you is carpeted with dead insects."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "XE_DAY_MESSAGES_1"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid "The grass nearby is trampled down in a sinuous pattern."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "XE_DAY_MESSAGES_1"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid "The air suddenly smells sickly sweet."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "XE_SCRAGGY-BOO_MESSAGES_1"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"<color_light_blue>You see a Russian sheepdog off at the edge of your vision."
"  It walks past some scenery and vanishes.</color>"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "XE_SCRAGGY-BOO_MESSAGES_1"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"<color_light_blue>You hear a deep guttural howl, faintly across the "
"way.</color>"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "XE_SCRAGGY-BOO_MESSAGES_1"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"<color_light_green>In your mind you hear a voice, as if a big dog were "
"speaking English.  'It's dangerous here, this whole world is dangerous "
"now'.</color>"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "XE_SCRAGGY-BOO_MESSAGES_1"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"<color_light_green>Scraggy-boo speaks in your mind.  'The real mystery is how"
" to survive this place'.</color>"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "XE_BOOK_LIES_CARRIED"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"<color_light_red>You catch a small glimpse of something.  The only thing you "
"understand is how disturbed it makes you feel.</color>"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "XE_BOOK_LIES_CARRIED"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"<color_light_red>You imagine yourself reading that creepy book.  Your mind "
"reels at the idea.</color>"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "XE_BOOK_LIES_CARRIED"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"<color_light_red>For the smallest instant, the veil hiding the truth shows a "
"crack.  What little you see shocks you to your very core.</color>"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "XE_BOOK_LIES_CARRIED"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"<color_light_red>Your proximity to this damned book is slowly melting your "
"mind.</color>"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "XE_BOOK_LIES_CARRIED"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"<color_light_red>You feel a deep longing to leave a certain book behind "
"you.</color>"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "XE_BOOK_LIES_CARRIED"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"<color_light_red>Your mind is on fire.  You must get rid of this book or the "
"fire won't end.</color>"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "XE_BOOK_LIES_CARRIED"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"<color_light_red>How cathartic it would be to tear the pages from that cursed"
" book.  You ache to get rid of it as soon as possible.</color>"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "XE_BOOK_LIES_CARRIED"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"<color_light_red>Your mind can only think about that book for a moment.  You "
"skull fills with pressure like a balloon about to pop.</color>"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "XE_BOOK_LIES_CARRIED"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"<color_light_red>That book you found near a shredded corpse makes you dread "
"being shredded in turn.</color>"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "XE_BOOK_LIES_CARRIED"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"<color_light_red>You suddenly feel saddened.  Maybe dropping that blood-"
"stained book would make you feel better?</color>"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "XE_BOOK_LIES_CARRIED"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"<color_light_red>The Lies hate that you're carrying that book and decided to "
"make their sentiment known.</color>"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares_book_lies"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"<color_light_red>You dream of a world of burning paper below a single intact "
"book.</color>"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares_book_lies"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"<color_light_red>You awaken from a nightmare about a book eating your "
"brain.</color>"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares_book_lies"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"<color_light_red>You stand on a line of letters above a bottomless pit.  They crack.  You fall.  You wake up.\n"
"This time.</color>"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares_book_lies"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"<color_light_red>You wake up knowing that you will soon pay for what you've "
"done.</color>"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares_book_lies"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"<color_light_red>You dream about being torn apart by unseen claws.</color>"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares_book_lies"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"<color_light_red>In your dream, you had a cat.  Like the cat, curiosity "
"killed you.  Unlike the cat, you had far less lives and died far more "
"times.</color>"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares_book_lies"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"<color_light_red>You dream about white-hot nails burrowing in your head, each"
" of them whispering things you do not want to hear.</color>"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares_book_lies"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"<color_light_red>You wake up with a phrase resounding in your skull over and "
"over: CLEAVE THROUGH THE WORLD OF LIES.</color>"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares_book_lies"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"<color_light_red>You dream about being unraveled, the strands making you "
"falling to the ground.</color>"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares_book_lies"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"<color_light_red>You dream about silent voices ordering other things to kill "
"you.</color>"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "book_lies_taint_resisted"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"<color_light_red>The Lies are unraveling you as you dared resist "
"them.</color>"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "book_lies_taint_resisted"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"<color_light_red>Small strands of skin and muscle are leaving your body and "
"piling on the floor.</color>"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "book_lies_taint_resisted"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"<color_light_red>Strand by strand, you are slowly unmade by the Lies.</color>"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "book_lies_taint_resisted"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"<color_light_red>You do not know enough to avoid what is happening to you, "
"but you know enough for it to happen.</color>"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "book_lies_taint_resisted"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"<color_light_red>Another small strand is plucked from you and "
"discarded.</color>"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "book_lies_taint_resisted"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"<color_light_red>If you stop reading this book, you will stop "
"unraveling.</color>"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "book_lies_taint_resisted"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"<color_light_red>Better stop provoking the Lies, before they take something "
"important.</color>"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "book_lies_taint_resisted"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"<color_light_red>If the eyes cannot stop you from reading this, the claws "
"will.</color>"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "book_lies_claw"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"<color_light_red>You've gone too far, and the Lies will destroy you for "
"it.</color>"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "book_lies_claw"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid "<color_light_red>An unseen claw grievously rends your flesh.</color>"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "book_lies_claw"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"<color_light_red>You notice a gaping wound you did not had a second ago.  "
"Reading this book is killing you.</color>"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "book_lies_claw"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"<color_light_red>You know too much about the Lies, and they are trying to "
"remedy to that.</color>"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "book_lies_claw"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"<color_light_red>Five invisible blades tear open your skin, leaving a "
"horrible wound.</color>"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "book_lies_claw"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"<color_light_red>A horrendous wound opens on its own as you read another word"
" from this book.</color>"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "book_lies_claw"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"<color_light_red>Reading this book feels like a dagger against your sanity.  "
"Its effects on your body are more tangible.</color>"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "book_lies_claw"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"<color_light_red>The Lies are sending a clear message: stop reading the book "
"or die by their hand.</color>"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "book_lies_claw"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"<color_light_red>A chunk of flesh is torn from your body by something you "
"cannot perceive.</color>"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "book_lies_claw"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"<color_light_red>You will be cleaved before you can cleave anything unless "
"you stop reading this book.</color>"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver, mon_mi_go_myrmidon
