#. ~ Snippet in category "XE_CHANGELING_COMMONER_POOKA"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/playable_changeling_dreams.json
msgid ""
"You dream of a raven landing on your outstretched arm and telling you what it"
